{
  "id": 1722,
  "name": "bitter-herba-mystica",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "深い苦味を　持つ　幻の調味料。体の免疫を　劇的に　高めると伝えられているが　真偽は　不明。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "깊은 쓴맛을 가진 환상의 조미료. 몸의 면역을 극적으로 강화한다고 전해지고 있으나, 진위는 불명이다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有深沉苦味的幻之調味料。相傳它會顯著地增強身體免疫力，但其真實性無從得知。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment fabuleux d’une amertume profonde. Les grimoires disent qu’une pincée suffit à décupler les défenses immunitaires, mais cela n’a pas été prouvé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein sehr bitter schmeckendes, mystisches Würzmittel. Gerüchten zufolge soll es das Immunsystem des Körpers drastisch stärken. Beweise dafür fehlen jedoch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento legendario con un fuerte sabor amargo. Se dice que refuerza el sistema inmunitario, mas este dato no se ha comprobado a ciencia cierta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento leggendario dall’intenso gusto amaro. Si dice che causi un significativo incremento delle difese immunitarie, ma la veridicità di ciò non è confermata.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A legendary condiment with a deeply bitter taste. It’s said to dramatically bolster a body’s immune defenses, though that hasn’t been proven.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "深い苦味を　持つ　幻の調味料。体の免疫を　劇的に　高めると伝えられているが　真偽は　不明。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "拥有浓厚苦味的奇幻调味料。相传能大幅提高身体的免疫力，但事实真实性不明。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
